[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4113413044","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117398#issuecomment-4113413044","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117398","id":4113413044,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc71LbO0","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-23T20:13:56Z","updated_at":"2026-03-25T08:55:37Z","body":"Symbol lookup is a feature of the language. If there is a bug with the GDScript implementation it should be fixed there. Masking language specific bugs in the general editor code is a bad idea.\r\n\r\n~Also please be aware that in case you are using AI for your contribution you are required to disclose it, as outlined in our [policy on AI-assisted contributions](https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#ai-assisted-contributions).~","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4113413044/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4113951005","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117398#issuecomment-4113951005","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117398","id":4113951005,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc71Nekd","user":{"login":"Dowsley","id":22419861,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDE5ODYx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22419861?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley","html_url":"https://github.com/Dowsley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-23T21:51:48Z","updated_at":"2026-03-23T21:52:09Z","body":"> Symbol lookup is a feature of the language. If there is a bug with the GDScript implementation it should be fixed there. Masking language specific bugs in the general editor code is a bad idea.\r\n\r\nAgreed conceptually. However, placing the fix inside `lookup_code` would require it to hve an ability to know whether it's inside a comment or not. I believe this will require to change its signature somehow, and if I'm right, this turns into a cross-cutting API change for a minor UX bug. Do you think this is the way to go, or have another suggestion?\r\n\r\n> Also please be aware that in case you are using AI for your contribution you are required to disclose it, as outlined in our [policy on AI-assisted contributions](https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#ai-assisted-contributions).\r\n\r\nNo AI has been used, this fix is pretty trivial. If I'm guessing right and the idea comes from the description, it's just how I write, I know bullet points are out of fashion nowadays.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4113951005/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4114009498","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117398#issuecomment-4114009498","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117398","id":4114009498,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc71Ns2a","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-23T22:02:56Z","updated_at":"2026-03-23T22:02:56Z","body":"> Agreed conceptually. However, placing the fix inside `lookup_code` would require it to hve an ability to know whether it's inside a comment or not. I believe this will require to change its signature somehow, and if I'm right, this turns into a cross-cutting API change for a minor UX bug. Do you think this is the way to go, or have another suggestion?\r\n\r\nThe editor does its own comment parsing but it's not like GDS has no concept of comments. They are handled in the tokenizer. So by tracking positioning information in the tokenizer gdscript should be able to figure this out on its own.\r\n\r\nThis will be more work I guess, however the issue is that `lookup_code` is not exclusively used by the builtin editor. So it is necessary anyway if we want to fix the bug for external editors as well.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4114009498/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4124294739","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117398#issuecomment-4124294739","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117398","id":4124294739,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc71075T","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-25T07:11:30Z","updated_at":"2026-03-25T07:11:30Z","body":"This bug (or feature) exists due to an optimization in `GDScriptLanguage::lookup_code()`. For some global symbols, the method returns the result immediately, without parsing. If we always run the parser and properly resolve symbols, the method won't find a result for words in comments, as they are skipped.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/64596092ae60e8fc10da7b61ac024d099a80a3b7/modules/gdscript/gdscript_editor.cpp#L4299-L4323","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4124294739/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4124843739","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117398#issuecomment-4124843739","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117398","id":4124843739,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc713B7b","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-25T08:55:10Z","updated_at":"2026-03-25T08:55:10Z","body":"> If we always run the parser and properly resolve symbols, the method won't find a result for words in comments, as they are skipped.\r\n\r\nNote though, that this would also break resolution in doc comment `[]` tags.\r\n\r\nWhile I think this qualifies as bug and we need to get rid of those optimizations (mainly to improve reliability of the LSP rename feature). I don't think doing it at the cost of loosing doc comment support is worth it.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4124843739/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4125128410","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117398#issuecomment-4125128410","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117398","id":4125128410,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc714Hba","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-25T09:44:37Z","updated_at":"2026-03-25T09:44:37Z","body":"> I don't think doing it at the cost of loosing doc comment support is worth it.\r\n\r\nIn this case, doc comments should be parsed properly so that only links inside tags like `[SomeClass]` and `[member SomeClass.property]` are clickable, and not arbitrary words in the comment.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4125128410/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4127844572","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117398#issuecomment-4127844572","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117398","id":4127844572,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc72Cejc","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-25T16:07:58Z","updated_at":"2026-03-25T16:12:47Z","body":"I mentioned it here https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117306, but I don't think this needs to be changed, it can be useful and doesn't really cause problems.\r\nWhen I was refactoring `CodeEdit::get_lookup_word` I made sure it still worked in comments, so its not unintentional either.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4127844572/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4128167428","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117398#issuecomment-4128167428","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117398","id":4128167428,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc72DtYE","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-25T16:51:29Z","updated_at":"2026-03-25T17:07:52Z","body":"The current implementation of `lookup_code` might be fine for hover hints and navigation, but it is an issue for refactor symbol functionality IMO.\r\n\r\n(CodeEdit::get_lookup_word is a mistake in the first place. Identifier boundaries for lookup are language dependent. See e.g. https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/94195 or think C++ `operator String()`)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4128167428/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]